  "name": "The Three-Fold Path",
  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Triathlon returns, performing at a Triune Understanding rally. The Avengers search for Lord Templar and Pagan, eventually finding the latter and engaging him in combat, with Triathlon aiding them. Templar appears in the midst of the battle and blasts Pagan, leaving with Pagan moments later. Lord Templar is revealed as Jonathon Tremont."
